    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90698" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφορ-ά</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pronunciation, utterance</i>, <i><span class="en">
